{"id":"darauf","lemma":"darauf","pos":"adv","rank":254,"glosses":["after (behind; later in time; following)","on top of that","on it"],"ipa":"/daˈʁaʊ̯f/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f9/De-darauf.ogg/De-darauf.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du hast mein Wort darauf.","en":"You have my word on it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695696","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"word as an isolated unit"},null]},{"text":"Darauf habe ich keine Antwort.","en":"I have no answer for that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698568","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"answer"}]},{"text":"Ich bin nicht stolz darauf.","en":"I'm not proud of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700149","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"proud"},null]},{"text":"Ich gebe dir mein Wort darauf.","en":"I give you my word on it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"word as an isolated unit"},null]},{"text":"Darauf kannst du stolz sein.","en":"You can be proud of that.","words":[null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"proud"},{"g":"to be"}]}]}